<div class="container container-spacing light-bg" name="species-information">
  <div class="section species-information">
    <h2>Species information</h2>
    <div>
      <h4>&nbsp;</h4>
      <h4>Identification</h4>
      <p>They are often found in open, sunny areas like heaths, moorlands, and dry stone walls.</p>
      <p><strong>Viviparous</strong> means they give birth to live young, not eggs.</p>
      <hr />
      <h4>Distribution</h4>
      <p>Common in Scotland</p>
